          "value": "<p>Immune to Charmed and Shaken — it is a principle, not a person. Creatures that deal qliphothic damage to it must succeed a Soul check (DC by tier) or be Restrained by the sephirah's answer until the end of their next turn. It does not pursue anyone who leaves its ground.</p><p><em>It does not hate intruders. It corrects them.</em></p>",
